&lt;p&gt;Astranis has raised over $1.2 billion from some of the world’s best investors, including Andreessen Horowitz, Baillie Gifford, Blackrock, Fidelity, Franklin Templeton, and Snowpoint, and employs a team of 500 engineers and entrepreneurs. Astranis designs, builds, and operates its satellites out of its 153,000 sq. ft. headquarters in Northern California, USA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Antenna Intern (Winter 2027)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
